<TabItem Header="Creator Info"><StackPanel Margin="7,9"><TextBlock Text="Creator Name" FontWeight="Bold"/><TextBox x:Name="CreatorBox" TextChanged="ExtraFieldChanged" Margin="0,5,0,5"/><TextBlock Text="This is the creator's name." FontStyle="Italic" Foreground="#AAAAAA" Margin="0,0,0,12"/><TextBlock Text="Website / Store URL" FontWeight="Bold"/><TextBox x:Name="WebsiteBox" TextChanged="ExtraFieldChanged" Margin="0,5,0,5"/><TextBlock Text="Link to the creator's main website or store." FontStyle="Italic" Foreground="#AAAAAA" Margin="0,0,0,12"/><TextBlock Text="Support URL" FontWeight="Bold"/><TextBox x:Name="SupportBox" TextChanged="ExtraFieldChanged" Margin="0,5,0,5"/><TextBlock Text="Link for help and troubleshooting." FontStyle="Italic" Foreground="#AAAAAA" Margin="0,0,0,22"/><TextBlock Text="Description" FontWeight="Bold"/><TextBox x:Name="NotesBox" TextChanged="ExtraFieldChanged" Height="72" AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,5,0,5"/><TextBlock Text="Description and original creator credits. Included in Project/creators.json on build." Foreground="#AAAAAA" FontStyle="Italic" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></StackPanel></TabItem>
